<title>CANADA: Koala Beverages acquires snack food company.</title>
<headline>Koala Beverages acquires snack food company.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Koala Beverages Limited said on Thursday it had acquired Poor Boy Snack Foods Limited of Edmonton, Alberta.  Poor Boy distributes beverages and snack food products.</p>
<p>Koala Beverages also said C$3.9 million was raised through sales of marketing limited partnership units that closed on December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
